<title>HONG KONG: IADB launches US$1.0 bln global bond.</title>
<headline>IADB launches US$1.0 bln global bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by joint lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   $1.O BLN	SPREAD     17 BP	MATURITY   07.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE  GLOBAL	  BASE    FEB 07 TSY    PAY DATE   07.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	ISS PRICE  **	   LAUNCH     04.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	REOFFER    **	   FULL FEES   32.5 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/NY   DENOMS (K) 1OOO</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12.5 BP  SELL CONC  20 BP	PAY FREQ    SEMI</p>
<p>NOTES - ** TO BE PRICED AT AROUND 4 PM LONDON TIME  LEADS	MORGAN STANLEY, CS FIRST BOSTON</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
